'''DONALD MORDEN''' (モーデン元帥 ''Mōden gensui'', '''Morden Marshal''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = DONALD MORDEN
|image = E 190.png
|appearance = [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,900¢ - 7,505¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health and damage along with fair range and attack rate, an overall challenging backliner to deal with. Treat it like a shorter ranged [[Camelle]].

==Strategy==
Use meatshields to minimize Morden's pushing power, and use units that have over 420 range like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]].

